        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "done",
        "body": "A tile that falls back to a minimap rebuilt all of them whenever a zoom crossed a level (twelve canvases, blank until redrawn). Fixed in three places; 27-37 redraws per level-crossing zoom became 4 and none are remounted. App b4493faf. Not fixed: the zoom commit still takes about half a second in a dev build.",
