        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "done",
        "body": "The Glossary, Navigation, the Authoring contract and the Starter have a Page Route to the library (a link on the page); the Edge classes and Templates have a portal. The Node class library is a legacy graph still to be rewritten, so it is the one shelf without a way back, named in tests/libraryLinks.test.js, which says when to take it off. The Starter now has \"The Library\" beside \"The Twilite Zone\", so every graph that begins from it has the link too: Michael to say if a new graph should not.",
