          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1793211204335,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        },
        "notes": "2026-10-28: the count is thirteen now (the Root contract is out, the Graph contract is to be replaced). These pages only had their structure converted; their prose still says \"declaration\" and \"view\" in the old sense, so this follows p2b."
      }
