        "title": "Rebuild the contracts, root contract first",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "library-made-current",
          "nodeId": "library-made-current-p2b-rebuild-contracts"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "in-progress",
        "body": "The contracts describe what was being built, not where it is now. The thirteen listed ones have only had their structure converted: their text still says \"declaration\" and \"view\" in the old sense (Declaration contract: \"declaration\" 31 times; Document authoring 15; Gesture ownership 17; Library graph 11). Order: (1) review the Root contract (declarations/declaration-contract) claim by claim against the code and the model, show the changes, and write nothing to canon until approved; (2) the Graph contract; (3) a new short contract, \"Starting from nothing\", to replace docs/twilite-native-graph-v1.md (its save rule, landing-surface, field and portal-option claims are stale); (4) the bridge, edge-class, port, document and gesture contracts; (5) the unconverted ones that are still alive (node, node instance, edge, layout authority, typography, the view family, errors), only when work touches them. The 73 retired files (57 of them skills) are not rebuilt.",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1793214552760,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        },
        "notes": "2026-10-28: the older skill and manifest-era contracts are retired (73 files); the Root contract is retired; the Root primitive is the source of truth for the root. All fifteen primitive pages are checked against the code and corrected. Still to do: the Graph contract (replace), then the bridge, edge-class, port, document and gesture contracts, which only had their structure converted. 2026-10-29: the Graph contract is replaced by \"What makes a graph valid\"."
      }
