        "title": "Rename the validator codes that use retired words",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "library-made-current",
          "nodeId": "library-made-current-validator-codes"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "done",
        "body": "DECLARATION_COUNT_INVALID, DECLARATION_MULTIPLE_ROOT, DECLARATION_ROOT_RELATIONSHIP_MISSING and LANDING_SURFACE_MULTIPLE (it means the ground), and remove the dictionary ones (DICTIONARY_MISSING_FILE, DICTIONARY_MISSING_VIEW, CLASS_AUTHORITY_MISSING_ENTRY). One code change.",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1793246103253,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        },
        "notes": "2026-10-29: DECLARATION_COUNT_INVALID is ROOT_MISSING, DECLARATION_MULTIPLE_ROOT is ROOT_MULTIPLE, DECLARATION_MULTIPLE_IN_CLUSTER is ROOT_MULTIPLE_IN_CLUSTER, DECLARATION_ROOT_RELATIONSHIP_MISSING is ROOT_RELATIONSHIP_MISSING, LANDING_SURFACE_MULTIPLE is GROUND_MULTIPLE; the legacy dependency and dictionary checks (CLASS_AUTHORITY_MISSING_ENTRY, DICTIONARY_*) are removed; the messages say root and ground."
      }
    },
