        "status": "done",
        "body": "A fragment is a piece of a node, kept in its own file. The page is staged like the Root, its example pair is in canon beside it (library/primitives/fragment/example), the Portal, Bridge and Root pages say where it stands, and tests/fragmentSmoke.test.js proves expand, collapse and the refusals. The stand-in has an Expand/Collapse button and is no longer a way through. Published 29 October.",
