        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "done",
        "body": "A Method, Script, Import or Export in a piece used to arrive with its own source and grants. They now arrive as a note unless the host's own stand-in grants them with target.allow: a type name, or { type, ref } for one Bridge by its address. The grant is read from the host only, never from the piece or the caller (utils/fragmentGrants.js).",
