        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node",
        "owner": "Michael",
        "status": "todo",
        "body": "scripts/deploy-live.ps1 sends the remote preflight with a byte-order mark in front of \"set\", so the server prints \"bash: line 1: set: command not found\". The deploy still completes. Send the script without the mark.",
